  "rootCause": "Because of a lack of Access control over specific functions 0x7ca06d68 , Attacker can manipulate the _uniswapV3MintCallback value and execute the attack contract directly. Code Snippet: Attack Tx: https://etherscan.io/tx/0x93a033917fcdbd5fe8ae24e9fe22f002949cba2f621a1c43a54f6519479caceb https://app.blocksec.com/explorer/tx/eth/0x93a033917fcdbd5fe8ae24e9fe22f002949cba2f621a1c43a54f6519479caceb Analysis: https://blog.solidityscan.com/civnft-hack-analysis-4ee79b8c33d1",
